 "title": "The 7 Noachide Laws (sheva mitzvot b'nei noah)",
 "summary": "Introduces the seven Noachide Laws, the seven commandments the Torah is said to give to Gentiles, applying to all mankind descended from Noah. Shows the Hebrew name שבע מצוות בני נח, with 'seven' and the 'No' of Noah picked out in colour, and a note citing Sanhedrin 58b of the Talmud.",
