  {
   "lang": "en",
   "role": "body",
   "text": "The Torah* gives seven laws מצוות mitzvot for Gentiles to observe. These seven laws apply to all mankind who are all descended from Noah; ergo, Noachide Laws."
  },
  {
   "lang": "en",
   "role": "note",
   "text": "*according to Sanhedrin 58b of the Talmud"
  }
 ],
